## Why This Is Asked

This question probes designing a scalable, compliant incident-response assistant that isolates tenants, enforces cost controls, and integrates with Azure Monitor, Cognitive Search, RBAC, and auditing.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant sandboxed OpenAI deployments behind API Management
- Event-driven ingestion from Azure Monitor
- KB grounding via Cognitive Search
- PII redaction with Text Analytics
- RBAC with Azure AD and Data Lake auditing
- Canary rollout and end-to-end tests

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo routing function outline
async function handleIncident(event) {
  const tenant = extractTenant(event);
  const doc = await kbSearch(tenant, event);
  const prompt = buildPrompt(doc, event);
  const redacted = redactPII(prompt);
  const res = await openaiQuery(tenant, redacted);
  await logAudit(tenant, event, res);
}
```

